# sample_text in a browser: the page's tree enabled through its hidden
# button, as for the controls; then the Notes field as on the desktop,
# typed into, read by character, word and line, a selection made and
# deleted, the reader asked what has the focus as the walk reaches it.
key b
key Return
wait 3
key Tab
key Tab
focus
type hello world
key Left
hold ctrl Left
hold ctrl Left
hold ctrl Right
key End
hold shift Left
key BackSpace
key Return
type two
key Up
key Down
# Said by NVDA in Chrome as by the desktop readers.
expect Notes
expect hello
expect world
expect two
